  "output_text": "In twilight's hush where shadows softly fall\nAmidst the trees their vigil keep\nThe wind whispers secrets to the wall\nAnd darkness gathers, dark and deep\n\nThe stars appear like diamonds bright\nA canopy of light above\nThe world is bathed in lunar light\nAnd all the night's dark magic love\n\nThe moon's pale beams upon the sea\nDo dance and sparkle, wild and free\nThe waves caress the sandy shore\nAnd in the darkness, peace is found\n\nIn this still hour, the heart doth sing\nA melody of love and peace\nThe world is full of beauty's ring\nAnd all the darkness, love release",
